:: Sister Stretch Hands [scene] {"position":"1425,3900","size":"100,100"}
/* Micro event scene (MICRO_EVENTS_PLAN.md, Sister Living Room Stretch, tier 2 "Yearning": after What Are We, before the
   Catalyst Night). Opened from Sister Living Room Stretch with <<MicroScene>>. The rep contest, loser does what the
   winner says, and she stops one rep short on purpose. On the mat, sweaty, her hand; she wipes it off on my shirt.
   Variants: the first time, her lust high (she wanted someone to lose to her, and then loses), and a near miss: the
   vacuum cleaner upstairs goes quiet, which means $mom.callName is about to come down.
   Clips, images/characters/sister/events/stretch/ (check against the clips):
     hands_0.mp4   the rep contest on the mat, she stops one rep short and looks at me
     hands_1.mp4   we sit on the mat against the couch, her hand in my shorts, sweaty, her ponytail
     hands_2.mp4   the finish in her hand; she wipes it on my shirt */
<<silent>>
<<SetBackground $locations[2].img>>
<<set _sthFirst to setup.microSceneCount("sister", passage()) <= 1>>
<<set _sthEager to $sister.stats.lust >= setup.microTuning.lustHigh>>
<<set _sthNear to setup.rollNearMiss("sister")>>
<</silent>>
We do push-ups, side by side on the mat, counting out loud. She's faster than me, she's always been faster than me, and by fifteen I'm shaking and she's breathing easy and talking trash between reps.

<<linkreplace "Keep going">>
<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/stretch/hands_0.mp4">>

At nineteen she stops. She's at the top of the push-up with her arms straight, not shaking at all, and she looks over at me with her ponytail hanging down and lets herself down onto the mat, slowly, on purpose, and lies there.

<<silently>>
<<if _sthFirst>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $sister, text: "Oh no. I'm exhausted. I couldn't possibly do one more." },
{ who: $player, text: "You weren't even breathing hard." },
{ who: $sister, text: "I'm a very private breather. You won, $player.name. Go on, then. Loser does what the winner says." },
{ text: "She rolls onto her back on the mat and looks up at me, and the joke goes out of her face, and she waits." },
]>>
<<else>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $sister, text: "You won. Again. What a shock." },
{ text: "She rolls onto her back and waits to be told." },
]>>
<</if>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Tell her what the winner wants">>
I sit back against the front of the couch with my legs out on the mat, and tell her. Quietly, so it doesn't carry up the stairs.

<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/stretch/hands_1.mp4">>

She sits up and shuffles over next to me on the mat, her shoulder against mine, still warm and damp from the set, and slides her hand down the front of my shorts without any fuss. She takes hold of me and strokes me slowly, watching her own hand move under the fabric as if it's an exercise she's learning from the video. Her ponytail swings against my arm. She smells like her deodorant and clean sweat.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
{ who: $sister, text: "For the record, I could have done forty." },
{ who: $player, text: "I know." },
{ who: $sister, text: "I just want that on the record." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<if _sthNear>>
Upstairs, the vacuum cleaner has been droning along the hallway the whole time, back and forth, bumping into the skirting boards. Now it stops.

$sister.callName's hand stops with it. We both look at the ceiling. Somebody upstairs is winding up the cord, slowly, the way $mom.callName always does, loop by loop, so it doesn't tangle.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
{ who: $sister, text: "She always does the stairs last. She's going to come down the stairs." },
{ text: "She whispers it like a weather report. Then her hand starts again, tight and fast, and she presses her forehead against my shoulder so she can't see my face, and I can feel her grinning." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<</if>>

<<linkreplace "Finish">>
<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/stretch/hands_2.mp4">>

I come in her hand, inside my shorts, and she holds on through it and keeps stroking, slower, until I'm done. Then she draws her hand out and looks at it, and looks at me, and wipes it, very deliberately, down the front of my t-shirt.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
{ who: $player, text: "Seriously?" },
{ who: $sister, text: "Winner's prize. You can wash it yourself." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<if _sthNear>>
The vacuum starts up again at the top of the stairs. $sister.callName is already back on the mat, in plank position, pretending to be halfway through a set, and I'm in the kitchen with my back to the door, rinsing my shirt under the tap, when $mom.callName bumps the vacuum down the last step and asks if anybody's seen the attachment for the corners.
<<else>>
She unpauses the video and gets back on her mat for her cool-down, and I go and change my shirt.
<</if>>

<<set $sister.flags.handjobs to ($sister.flags.handjobs || 0) + 1>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterCorruption" 1>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "SisterLust" 20>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
<<if _sthNear>><<UpdateStat "+" "SisterExhibition" 1>><</if>>
<<EndMicroScene "Change your shirt">>
<</linkreplace>>
<</linkreplace>>
<</linkreplace>>


:: Sister Stretch Mouth [scene] {"position":"1550,3900","size":"100,100"}
/* Micro event scene (MICRO_EVENTS_PLAN.md, Sister Living Room Stretch, tier 3 "Devoted": after the Catalyst Night, before
