<<SetBackground $locations[2].img>>
<<set _stmFirst to setup.microSceneCount("sister", passage()) <= 1>>
<<set _stmEager to $sister.stats.lust >= setup.microTuning.lustHigh>>
<</silent>>
<<if _stmEager>>
We get as far as five sit-ups. Then she stops, and lies back on the mat, and announces that she forfeits, and pulls me down by the shirt.
<<else>>
We do sit-ups this time, side by side, with our feet hooked under the couch. Neither of us is really counting. At twelve she lies back on the mat and doesn't come up again.
<</if>>

<<silently>>
<<if _stmFirst>>
<<set _msgs to [
{ who: $sister, text: "I lose. Tragic. I suppose I'll have to do whatever you want now." },
