<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Lie down on her mat">>
<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/stretch/mouth_0.mp4">>

I lie down on my back on her mat. It smells of her. She kneels next to me, by my hip, and pulls my shorts down to my thighs with both hands, and takes me in her hand, and then she leans over me with her ponytail falling over one shoulder and takes me in her mouth.

<<linkreplace "Let her">>
<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/stretch/mouth_1.mp4">>

She starts counting. Out loud, in between, the way the lady on her video does: "one," and down, slowly, all the way, and up, "two," and down. Her voice has the same bright, encouraging tone. "Three. Keep that core tight." She's laughing at herself, and doing it anyway, and every number she says gets a little breathier than the one before.

