<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/stretch/mouth_2.mp4">>

She makes a small sound and lets me take over. I hold her ponytail and move her head, faster than she'd been going, and she lets me, her lips tight, her breath hissing through her nose, her eyes on my face sideways from where she's kneeling. Spit runs down onto the mat. She'll have to clean it with the spray she keeps by the TV. She doesn't seem worried about that right now.

<<linkreplace "Finish">>
<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/stretch/mouth_3.mp4">>

At the end I pull her off by the ponytail and come on her face, and she holds still for it with her eyes squeezed shut and her mouth open, and it lands across her cheek and her lips and in her hair. Then she opens one eye and reaches blindly for the workout towel she keeps over the arm of the couch.

